From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Owner Placeholder <owner@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 20:18:48 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] rust: bindings: add linux/hwmon.h

Make the hwmon registration API (devm_hwmon_device_register_with_info()
and struct hwmon_chip_info, hwmon_ops, hwmon_channel_info and the sensor
and attribute enums) visible to Rust, so that a hwmon driver written in
Rust can use the bindgen-generated types instead of declaring them by
hand. No abstraction is added: a driver still wraps these calls itself.

Signed-off-by: OWNER NAME <owner@example.invalid>
---
 rust/bindings/bindings_helper.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/rust/bindings/bindings_helper.h b/rust/bindings/bindings_helper.h
index c706dda5b..1fc7a86ee 100644
--- a/rust/bindings/bindings_helper.h
+++ b/rust/bindings/bindings_helper.h
@@ -62,6 +62,7 @@
 #include <linux/firmware.h>
 #include <linux/fwctl.h>
 #include <linux/fs.h>
+#include <linux/hwmon.h>
 #include <linux/i2c.h>
 #include <linux/interrupt.h>
 #include <linux/io-pgtable.h>
